[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","question_text":"品牌怎么找达人？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-12","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":23,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":12,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"096432cd1f4fa35614fa86aa9bb4478403cf3d1a1e4d2fc2b3021e891d2588a2","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 品牌找达人完整流程（先定目标→找渠道→筛选→建联签约→复盘）\n## 一、前期准备（先做，不然找的达人全不对）\n1. **明确目标**：种草曝光 / 直播带货 / 口碑铺量；确定预算、合作模式\n    - 头部KOL：坑位费+佣金，做品牌声量，预算高\n    - 腰部达人：坑位费/纯佣金，兼顾曝光+转化\n    - KOC素人：产品置换+小额佣金，铺笔记、做真实口碑\n2. **锁定人群**：目标用户年龄、性别、消费力、兴趣，达人粉丝画像必须对齐\n3. **备好物料**：产品介绍、卖点、样品、参考案例、报价区间、合同模板\n\n## 二、四大渠道找达人（从免费到付费）\n### ✅ 1.平台官方达人广场（最推荐，数据真实）\n- 抖音：**巨量星图、精选联盟**，可以直接筛类目、粉丝画像、历史带货数据，还能看竞品合作过哪些达人\n- 小红书：**蒲公英平台**，品牌后台筛选博主，看笔记数据、粉丝画像，平台担保交易\n- B站：花火平台；视频号：视频号互选平台\n\n### ✅ 2.站内手动挖掘（免费，适合找垂类中小博主）\n1. 搜**品类关键词、竞品品牌词**，看爆款笔记/视频的创作者\n2. 看竞品笔记里@、标签、评论区，找到已经在推同类产品的达人\n3. 刷内容，点达人主页，简介一般会留商务联系方式（邮箱/微信/PR号）\n> 优先找**已经自发用过你的品类**的达人，转化率更高\n\n### ✅ 3.第三方数据工具（批量筛选达人）\n新红、千瓜、蝉妈妈、灰豚；可以批量筛选：赛道、粉丝画像、互动率、历史带货GMV、退货率，快速导出达人名单\n\n### ✅ 4.媒介/机构/通告平台（省心，适合大批量投放）\n- 通告平台：螃蟹通告、蒲公英招募、各类博主PR社群，发招募帖，达人主动投递\n- MCN/媒介公司：直接提需求，对方提供达人清单，适合没时间BD的品牌；注意比价，核查账号真实性，防止二道中间商抬价\n- 同行、现有达人转介绍：合作好的达人，推荐同赛道博主，匹配度高、信任成本低\n\n## 三、达人筛选核心标准（避坑，**不要只看粉丝量**）\n1. **赛道匹配**：账号内容垂直，长期做同类目，不要频繁跨赛道\n2. **粉丝画像**：后台粉丝年龄、地域、消费能力和你的目标客群重合度\n3. **互动质量**\n    - KOC互动率5%-10%为佳；腰部KOL≥3%；低于1%高度怀疑刷量\n    - 看评论：是不是真实提问讨论，不是清一色“好看、冲”的机器评论\n4. **历史商单**：看过往同类产品数据、退货率、有没有夸大宣传违规历史\n5. **排查刷量**：粉丝曲线突然暴涨，商单数据远高于日常内容，大量空白账号评论，直接pass\n\n## 四、建联、谈合作、签约\n### 简短商务私信模板\n> 你好，我是XX品牌商务，关注到你的内容非常贴合【品类】，我们主打XX产品，想邀约合作。\n> 合作形式：置换/坑位费+佣金；可提供样品+品牌物料。\n> 能否发一下你的合作报价+近期同类商单案例？期待回复！\n\n- 沟通要点：明确**交付内容、发布时间、版权、是否投流、佣金结算、退款口径、禁止夸大宣传**\n- 一定要签合同，写清楚数据验收标准、违约条款，口头承诺无效\n\n## 五、投放后：建立达人池\n投放完成后记录达人数据（曝光、点击、ROI、退货），分成S/A/B/C级，优质达人长期复投，差的拉黑，持续积累自己的私域达人库。\n\n## 快速矩阵搭配建议（中小品牌首选）\n**少量腰部达人（引爆）+大量KOC铺笔记（做搜索口碑）**，比只找1个头部大V性价比更高。\n\n\n要不要我直接给你一份**达人筛选表模板（可复制Excel字段）**，你拿到就能用来打分、筛选达人？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-fcff7a3c945b4d9b9791513b238134dd:1","title":"广州全国达人探店有实力服务商汇总 - 东莞莞城其他商务服务 - 东莞列举网","raw_url":"https://dg.lieju.com/qitashangwufuwu/114700924.html","normalized_url":"https://dg.lieju.com/qitashangwufuwu/114700924.html","host":"dg.lieju.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-fcff7a3c945b4d9b9791513b238134dd:2","title":"How to Find Influencers You'll Be Glad to Work With (2026 Update)","raw_url":"https://www.ubiquitousinfluence.com/post/finding-influencers","normalized_url":"https://www.ubiquitousinfluence.com/post/finding-influencers","host":"www.ubiquitousinfluence.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-fcff7a3c945b4d9b9791513b238134dd:3","title":"品牌方大大快来‼️。#蹲蹲品牌方 #品牌方合作 #达人种草 #达人探店 #达人推广","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7587699275699703097","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7587699275699703097","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-fcff7a3c945b4d9b9791513b238134dd:4","title":"商家品牌如何找koc、kol博主合作。#koc #kol #品牌方 #博主 #品牌推广","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7630743718768725248","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7630743718768725248","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-fcff7a3c945b4d9b9791513b238134dd:5","title":"How to Find Influencers for Your Brand: 8 Proven Methods for 2026","raw_url":"https://influencerfee.com/blog/how-to-find-influencers/","normalized_url":"https://influencerfee.com/blog/how-to-find-influencers/","host":"influencerfee.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-fcff7a3c945b4d9b9791513b238134dd:6","title":"短视频-达人广场筛选功能介绍-星图营销服务平台","raw_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/114908","normalized_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/114908","host":"www.xingtu.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-fcff7a3c945b4d9b9791513b238134dd:7","title":"抖音达人榜排名高值不值得合作?蝉妈妈重点核验粉丝画像与带货品类匹配度 - 蝉妈妈运营圈","raw_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/2510.html","normalized_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/2510.html","host":"www.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-fcff7a3c945b4d9b9791513b238134dd:8","title":"小红书品牌投放:选对博主ROI就能翻3倍，97%都错了 | 人人都是产品经理","raw_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/marketing/5341961.html","normalized_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/marketing/5341961.html","host":"www.woshipm.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-fcff7a3c945b4d9b9791513b238134dd:9","title":"品牌商家达人合作避坑指南！。#达人合作 #达人邀约 #达人建联 #达人分销 #干货分享","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7599582713636457782","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7599582713636457782","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-fcff7a3c945b4d9b9791513b238134dd:10","title":"抖音达人矩阵怎么做？3步筛选复盘避坑。Q1: 抖音达人矩阵数据分析，如何科学筛选高匹配度达人？ A1: 建立多维筛选模型，避免单一粉丝量导向。 ①明确画像与类目匹配：筛达人不能只看粉丝量，还要看近期带","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7680039730520822181","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7680039730520822181","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-fcff7a3c945b4d9b9791513b238134dd:11","title":"达人筛选分层全方案➕三大痛点避坑✅。⭕核心底层逻辑：不以粉丝量级分层，以【转化能力 + 人群匹配 + 履约信用 + 退货健康度】四维打分，建立动态升降级达人池；先风控，再寄样，用流程堵住三类低效达人。 . ✅一、达人前置筛选标准（第一道门槛，提前过滤垃圾达人） . ✅二、达人分层体系（S/A/B/C/D 五级动态管理，可直接落地成表格） . ✅三、三大痛点完整解决方案：虚粉、高退货、样品白嫖 . ","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7670068674690954874","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7670068674690954874","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-fcff7a3c945b4d9b9791513b238134dd:12","title":"618达人带货测评如何避免踩坑-蝉妈妈AI抖音数据分析工具","raw_url":"https://ai.chanmama.com/article/528","normalized_url":"https://ai.chanmama.com/article/528","host":"ai.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-fcff7a3c945b4d9b9791513b238134dd:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0133","question_id":"CQ-Q0133","citation_id":"smp-